Package: hexify
Title: Equal-Area Hex Grids on the Snyder ISEA Icosahedron
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Gilles", "Colling", , "gilles.colling051@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3070-6066"))
Description: Provides functions to build and use equal-area hexagonal discrete global grids using the Snyder ISEA projection. Includes a fast C++ core for projection and aperture quantization, and sf/terra-compatible R wrappers for grid generation and coordinate assignment.
